# --------------------------------------------------
# Go Build & Binaries
# --------------------------------------------------
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out
*.prof

# Common application build outputs
bin/
dist/
/main
/app
/server

# --------------------------------------------------
# Live Reload & Dev Tools (Air, Fresh, etc.)
# --------------------------------------------------
# Air live-reload tool build output
tmp/
tmp_build/

# --------------------------------------------------
# Environment Variables & Secrets
# --------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template

# --------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies (Go Modules)
# --------------------------------------------------
# vendor/ 디렉터리는 팀 규약에 따라 관리됩니다.
# vendor를 레포지토리에 커밋하지 않는 일반적인 구성인 경우 아래 주석을 해제하세요.
# vendor/

# --------------------------------------------------
